From: "Barak A. Pearlmutter" <barak+git@pearlmutter.net>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 18:30:00 +0000
Subject: do not build or install HOWTOs/Bible

HOWTOs/Bible/Bible-Preview.pdf, an excerpt of a book distributed with
neither license nor sources, is excluded from the Debian source (see
Files-Excluded in debian/copyright).  HOWTOs/Bible/Makefile.am then
installs an empty placeholder in its place, along with a README that
describes the preview and how to order the book.

Either install HOWTOs/Bible only when the PDF is present, or do not
build it at all.  The latter is done here.

Forwarded: not-needed
---
--- a/HOWTOs/Makefile.am
+++ b/HOWTOs/Makefile.am
@@ -1,6 +1,4 @@
 
-SUBDIRS = Bible
-
 # HTML files generated from ASCIIDOC sources
 #
 ASCIIDOC = \
